      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "131 patients with diagnosed vibration disease were examined. Intensity, type and localization of pain syndromes were detected with the use of numeral rating scale (NRS) and questionnaires for neuropathic pain (DN4, LANSS, Pain DETECT). Functions of ulnar and median nerves were studied by means of electroneuromyography. The authors revealed the association between changes of electroneuromyographic indices and pain evaluation according to NSR and DN4."},
